  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "According to the reports, suspected Allied Democratic Forces militants carried out an armed attack on several villages in North Kivu, eastern Democratic Republic of Congo, and the death toll has risen to 33.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-06:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On November 6, ADF forces raided a rural health clinic in Cantine-Aloya, North Kivu Province, killing 33 civilians and causing the release of six clinic patients suspected to have Ebola, one of them a confirmed case.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384239626:455"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The Allied Democratic Forces insurgency is an ongoing conflict waged by the Islamic State-aligned ADF in Uganda and the Democratic Republic of the Congo, against the governments of those two countries and MONUSCO.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384239626:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The map shows North Kivu in the Democratic Republic of the Congo, the place where the reports locate the attack.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-06:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "As the article records, the status of the conflict is ongoing.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1384239626:status"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:38Z",
      "text": "As the article records its figures, casualties on side 1 are listed as unknown, with many and 17+ killed, including at least 15 Tanzanians, 1 Malawian and 1 South African.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1384239626:casualties-side-1-"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "As the article records, casualties on side 2 are listed as 1,590–2,090+ killed in 1999, with 314+ captured.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1384239626:casualties-side-2-"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:50Z",
      "text": "Uganda is also named in the reports.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-06:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:00:59Z",
      "text": "The reporting in this story is attributed to AA.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-06:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-06T00:01:07Z",
